  "summary_zh": "史庫塔瀑布位於赫本東側的Þorgeirsstaðadalur山谷，從一號公路轉入碎石支路後需短程步行，停車場步行到洞穴，約 20 分鐘可以走到，算是小巧有趣的洞穴。\n\n這洞穴最有趣的，可以走到洞口，朝著外頭看，形成特別的構圖景觀。",
  "summary_en": "Skutafoss is located in the Þorgeirsstaðadalur valley east of Höfn. From the Ring Road (Route 1) turn onto the gravel side road and park in the free parking lot. It’s about a 20‑minute walk from the parking area to the small cave. The walk is short and the site is compact, making it a fun stop where you can enter the cave and look out to enjoy a unique composition of the scenery.",
